{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3","name":"Nonheroic","source":{"id":"source:reference-1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3","title":"Nonheroic","revision":26724,"timestamp":"2025-07-04T21:28:55Z","sha256":"fa0b5cb3aa1d8f899d6a235092a86f40a7d79e3ab2b31490b1a6eb1ca4a7c2b0","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=26724","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Nonheroic&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Nonheroic characters include everything from professional workers to petty criminals, police officers to common thugs. They lack the inclination or training to be heroes. but they are capable in their own fields. Skilled engineers, educated professors, and master architects are all Nonheroic characters, as is the local governor, the self-serving spice merchant, and the baseline Imperial ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stormtrooper"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stormtrooper","referenceId":"reference:9d7164e03c073efe"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Nonheroic characters do not gain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"},", do not add their Nonheroic Class Level to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Defense Scores"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Defense_Scores"},", and do not gain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny_Points"},". In addition, they only get to increase one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ability Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ability_Score"}," by one point every fourth level (instead of increasing two scores by one point each). However, they gain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feats"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feats","referenceId":"reference:9194ccf56b9cace0"}," normally as they advance in level.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Creating Non-Human Characters"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Nonheroic characters frequently use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," Species as their baseline. If you wish to change the character's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"},", follow these simple rules:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["Remove one of the character's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feats"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feats","referenceId":"reference:9194ccf56b9cace0"},". (",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," characters gain a bonus ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feat"},")."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Remove one of the character's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained_Skills"},". (",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," characters gain a bonus ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained_Skill"},")."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Add the relevant Species Traits for the selected ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"},"."]}]},"\n","\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Game Rule Information"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Nonheroic characters have the following game statistics:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","